<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong>NISM Certification Exam Eligibility</strong></h3>
<p style="color: #000;" align="justify">
According to NISM guidelines:<br />
NISM certification exams are accessible to all individuals, regardless of age or educational background. There are no specific prerequisites concerning prior education or age limits, making these certifications inclusive for anyone interested in the Indian securities markets.
</p>

<h4 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Special Cases: Guidance for Foreign Nationals</h4>
<p style="color: #000;" align="justify">
If you're a <strong>foreign national appointed as a Director</strong> or holding a senior position at a stock broking firm or another <strong>market intermediary</strong>, and your role requires regulatory compliance via NISM certification — there is a formal process to support you.
</p>

<p style="color: #000;" align="justify"><strong>Here's what you should do:</strong></p>
<ul style="color: #000;">
  <li><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Contact the <strong>NISM Certification Team directly via email</strong> for personalized assistance</li>
  <li><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Get guidance on <strong>enrollment procedures, exam requirements, and documentation</strong></li>
  <li><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Ensure you are aligned with <strong>SEBI regulations and NISM eligibility standards</strong></li>
</ul>

<p style="color: #000;" align="justify">
This route ensures you receive <strong>up-to-date, accurate instructions</strong> for completing your NISM certification — especially for cross-border or exceptional scenarios.
</p>

