<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong>NISM Exam Centres Across India</strong></h2><br />

<p style="color: #000;">All NISM certification exams are conducted <strong>offline at authorized test centres</strong>. Candidates must be physically present at their chosen center on exam day, under secure supervision and regulated conditions.</p>

<!-- Two-column boxed layout for Locations and Registration -->
<div class="row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
  <!-- Locations box -->
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; height: 100%;">
      <h4 style="color:#0d47a1;">Locations:</h4>
      <p style="color: #000; margin-bottom: 0;">
        Exam centers are available across major Indian cities, making it easy to find a nearby location. Popular hubs include:
      </p>
      <ul style="color: #000;">
        <li>Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Chennai, Hyderabad, Kolkata, Ahmedabad, Pune and 200+ other centers across India.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Registration box -->
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; height: 100%;">
      <h4 style="color:#0d47a1;">Registration & Slot Booking:</h4>
      <p style="color: #000; margin-bottom: 0;">
        While registering for a NISM exam, you can choose your preferred test center and time slot. It’s recommended to <strong>book early</strong> during peak seasons (e.g., placement drives or end-of-quarter hiring cycles).
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

<!-- What to Carry -->
<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong>What to Carry on Exam Day</strong></h3>
<ul style="color: #000;">
  <li><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Government-issued Photo ID (Aadhaar, PAN, Passport, etc.)</li>
  <li><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Your NISM Exam Admit Card (downloaded from the portal)</li>
</ul>
<p style="color: #000;">Entry to the exam center is strictly monitored, and candidates without proper documents will be denied entry.</p>

<!-- Exam Fees -->
<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong>NISM Exam Fees</strong></h3>
<p style="color: #000;">
  The National Institute of Securities Markets (NISM) offers a range of certification examinations tailored for professionals in the securities markets. The examination fees vary depending on the specific certification, and can be completed online via credit card, debit card, or net banking.
</p>

<!-- Certificate Validity -->
<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong>Certificate Validity</strong></h3>
<p style="color: #000;">
  The validity of NISM certifications varies depending on the specific certification. Here is a general overview of the validity and renewal process for NISM certifications:
</p>
<p style="color: #000;">
  <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
  <strong>Most NISM Certifications:</strong> Valid for <strong>3 years</strong> from the date of issuance.
</p>
<p style="color: #000;">
  <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
  <strong>Continuing Professional Education (CPE) Certifications:</strong> If renewed through a CPE program, the validity extends for another <strong>3 years</strong> from the renewal date.
</p>

<!-- Registration Process -->
<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong>How to Register for NISM Certification</strong></h3>
<p style="color: #000;">Follow these step-by-step instructions to complete your <strong>NISM certification registration</strong> process smoothly:</p>

<ol style="color: #000;">
  <li>
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    Visit the official NISM portal <a href="https://cert.nism.ac.in" target="_blank">cert.nism.ac.in</a> and click on the <em>“New Account”</em> option to begin your registration.
  </li>  
  <li>
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    <strong>Complete your profile:</strong> You’ll need to upload:
    <ul>
      <li>A passport-size photo (JPG format)</li>
      <li>Aadhar card (JPG format)</li>
      <li>PAN card (JPG format)</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    <strong>Profile Approval:</strong> After registration and document verification, your profile is usually approved within <strong>3 working days</strong>.
  </li>

  <li>
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    <strong>Login and Book Your Exam:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Select the desired NISM exam module (e.g., <strong>NISM Series V-A</strong>)</li>
      <li>Choose your preferred <strong>city, date, and time slot</strong></li>
      <li>Pay the exam fee: <strong>Rs. 1,500 to 5,900</strong> (depending on your selected module)</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    <strong>Online Exam Option:</strong> If you prefer to take the exam from home, select “<strong>Online</strong>” as the location during booking.
  </li>
  <li>
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    <strong>Study Material:</strong> Download the official NISM workbook from the portal after booking. This includes all relevant case studies and practice questions.
  </li>
</ol>

