<h3 class="mt-5" style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 28px;"><strong> FAQs – NISM Certification Exam</strong></h3>

<div class="accordion faq-section mt-3" id="faqNISMCertification">

  <!-- Q1 -->
  <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid #1565c0; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
      <button class="accordion-button"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapseOne"
              aria-expanded="true"
              aria-controls="collapseOne"
              style="background-color: #f1f8ff; font-weight: bold; color: #0D0D68; font-size: 16px;">
        1. Can I use electronic items like a calculator during the exam?
      </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#faqNISMCertification">
      <div class="accordion-body" style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; color: #000;">
        Yes, calculators are permitted during the exam. However, no other electronic devices such as mobile phones, smartwatches, or tablets are allowed.

        <p class="mt-3"><strong>Exam Regulations & Candidate Instructions:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>All candidates must follow the proctor/invigilator instructions.</li>
          <li>Unfair practices (cheating, communication, impersonation) will result in disqualification and ban.</li>
          <li>Carry a valid photo ID (Aadhaar, PAN, Passport). Entry will be denied without it.</li>
          <li>Special accommodations are available on advance request with documentation.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Q2 -->
  <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid #1565c0; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
      <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapseTwo"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapseTwo"
              style="background-color: #f1f8ff; font-weight: bold; color: #0D0D68; font-size: 16px;">
        2. What happens if I fail the NISM exam? Is there a refund policy?
      </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#faqNISMCertification">
      <div class="accordion-body" style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; color: #000;">
        No refund is given if you fail. You will need to re-register and repay the exam fee.

        <p class="mt-3"><strong>Exceptions:</strong> If NISM cancels your exam, a full refund is processed automatically.</p>

        <p><strong>Rescheduling & Re-evaluation:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>You may reschedule before the exam (charges may apply). <a href="https://certifications.nism.ac.in/" target="_blank">Check policy here</a>.</li>
          <li>No re-evaluation is allowed. For technical issues, contact NISM support.</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Data Privacy:</strong> All personal data is protected under NISM’s <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

        <p><em><strong>Tip:</strong> Always review the official exam handbook before test day.</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Q3 -->
  <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid #1565c0; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
      <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapseThree"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapseThree"
              style="background-color: #f1f8ff; font-weight: bold; color: #0D0D68; font-size: 16px;">
        3. How can I pay the NISM certification fees?
      </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#faqNISMCertification">
      <div class="accordion-body" style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; color: #000;">
        Fees can be paid via credit card, debit card, or net banking through the official NISM portal during the exam booking process.
        <br><br>
        Refunds are only applicable if NISM cancels the exam.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Q4 -->
  <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid #1565c0; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
      <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapseFour"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapseFour"
              style="background-color: #f1f8ff; font-weight: bold; color: #0D0D68; font-size: 16px;">
        4. Is the NISM Exam available in Hindi?
      </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#faqNISMCertification">
      <div class="accordion-body" style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; color: #000;">
        Yes — currently only the <strong>NISM-Series-V-A: Mutual Fund Distributors</strong> exam is available in Hindi. Other modules are in English.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Q5 -->
  <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid #1565c0; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
      <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapseFive"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapseFive"
              style="background-color: #f1f8ff; font-weight: bold; color: #0D0D68; font-size: 16px;">
        5. What is the benefit of the NISM certificate?
      </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#faqNISMCertification">
      <div class="accordion-body" style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #0d47a1; color: #000;">
        NISM certification is mandatory for roles like mutual fund distributors and investment advisors. For example, the Series-V-A certification is required to get an ARN number from AMFI, enabling mutual fund distribution.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
